=== Test 9: rejection — non-DNF nesting ===
Expected error: only top-level OR / DNF is supported
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CTE_LOOKUP filter: only top-level OR / DNF is supported. Convert '(A OR B) AND C' to DNF or split into UNION.
